 of Oct 12, August to September has come in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 171% of normal for May to June in 2025 and 48% for August to September in 2025. So far in 2026, the middle of the grids shows April to May at 76% and June to July at 79% of normal. Grid 25417 had its driest year in 1980 at 66% of normal.</p>"}
